00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:27.940
name already in a sector rotation. That trade lost 4.17% while Nasdaq lost 0.9% over the same

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:36.420
window, producing negative 4.87% alpha. The rules-based record that began on August 18th, 2026

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:41.040
